    "created_at": "2015-12-13T00:27:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-13T00:27:26Z",
    "body": "The HTML spec, at least for the getter attributes, just delegates to [the URL spec](https://url.spec.whatwg.org).\n[`pathname` and `search`](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-url-pathname) are spec'd as being ASCII (i.e. percent-encoded).\n`hash` is spec'd as NOT being percent-encoded.\nSee also https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#url-code-points\nBased on your table, Chrome's behavior seems correct with respect to the current URL spec.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
