    "body": "So, it is specced, and Chrome is apparently correct, indeed, but for the host name, which should be 'ToUnicode' decoded, per spec (IIUC), and is rendered as punycode.\n\n`''+new URL(\"http://ø/ø?ø#ø\")` becomes\n-  `\"http://xn--pda/%C3%B8?%C3%B8#ø\"` in Chrome, \n- `\"http://ø/%C3%B8?%C3%B8#%C3%B8\"` in Firefox and \n- `\"http://xn--pda/%C3%B8?%C3%B8#%C3%B8\"` in Safari.\n\nWhat a mess :-)\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
